# # /brainwizard/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the BrainWizard knowledge-base vocabulary (kn).
#
# https://w3id.org/brainwizard/kn redirects to the Turtle file at
# https://github.com/vasilevladilie/brainwizard-kn
#
# Identifiers under /brainwizard/kb/<vault-id>/ name notes and studies in
# BrainWizard knowledge bases. They are not served: no redirect is defined
# for them yet.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# GitHub username: vasilevladilie

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^kn$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vasilevladilie/brainwizard-kn/main/kn.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/vasilevladilie/brainwizard-kn [R=302,L]
